<v Ira Glass>You mean specifically because you were a child?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:47.290
<v Eleanor Gordon-Smith>Yeah. Yeah. But also, because like what did he want there? What am I going to do in that scenario? Like, am I going to chase him? Am I going to actually give him my number so that he can call me in 11 years time when I am legal? Like, what's going to happen? What does he want there?

00:00:47.290 --> 00:01:11.210
